    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p><a href=\"http://www.stryker.com/en-us/corporate/AboutUs/Newsroom/ProductBulletins/ssLINK/169963\" target=\"_blank\">Stryker announced the launch of Altrix™</a>, a next-generation precision temperature management system that can be used in all clinical settings. “Patient warming and cooling can be critical in achieving positive patient outcomes. The device fulfills&nbsp;our commitment to our customers, providing simple, safe and efficient solutions that enable confident patient care,” said Gideon Brewer, Stryker’s Medical Portfolio Manager.<br>\n</p>\n<p><b>Read entire article:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.stryker.com/stellent/groups/corporate/documents/web_prod/169963.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Stryker.com</a></p>\n",
